January 6, 2023 | https://themaister.net/blog/2023/01/05/vulkan-video-shenanigans-ffmpeg-radv-integration-experiments/ | <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://themaister.net/blog/2023/01/05/vulkan-video-shenanigans-ffmpeg-radv-integration-experiments/">archive.org</a>
